. 34. Which of the tbllowing is the correct arrangement of the Monroe Motivated Sequence, ina persuasive speech organizational pattern?
A. Need, Attention. Satisfaction, Visualization, ActionB. Attention, Need, Visualization, Satisfaction, ActionC. Attention, Need. Visualization, Action, SatisfactionD. Attention. Need. Satisfaction. Visualization. Action35. Logos is one of the components in methods of persuasion. What is the function of Logosin a persuasive speech?A. CredibilityB. Aesthetic contentC. Logical explanationD" Appealing to emotion36. Which of the statements below are related to ethos in the method of persuasion?
I. Establishing credibility.il. Getting your audience to trust you.m. Showing that you are knowledgeable.IV. Presenting arguments based on reasons and facts.A. I, iI and IIIB. I, III and IVC. II, III and IVD. I, II, III and IV37. Which of the fbllowing is NOT the purpose of a persuasive speech?
A. l-o influence the audience's beliefs or attitudes.B. T'o motivate the audience to take action on an issue.Cl. fo present neutral facts for the audience to consider.D. -fo convince the audience to adopt a specific viewpoint.
